供しているかもしれない。くらいに捉えた方が正しそうです。","ts":"1621683006.107000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80d3b36b-3b9f-4073-9ebc-b7a412322a21","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"LSP 自体で定義された機能は coc 本体のドキュメントを見ないといけません。(関数や変数の参照を取得する機能は LSP 本体で定義されているので coc 本体側の機能です)","ts":"1621682958.106900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OteP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f856934-8a36-44c4-90ac-6a4d0453d638","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"これは拡張の方のコマンドですね。coc.nvim側を見るとよいです。（コマンドはあったかな？mapしててそれ使ってるから・・・）","ts":"1621682937.106800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBB2="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1df0a28b-c373-45c1-b8d4-592fb3cf992f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"流石に対応している気がしますが、ドキュメントが見当たらず、という状態です","ts":"1621682876.105800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XhM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"847aef96-20ef-4cc2-a664-1835c1f72df5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"を見るとそれらしきコマンドが見当たらないんですよね…","ts":"1621682862.105400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YouNk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f7c24a9-d587-494a-8805-9d24580953da","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/josa42/coc-go#commands\u003e","ts":"1621682844.104800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: josa42/coc-go","id":1,"title":"josa42/coc-go","title_link":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go#commands","text":"Go language server extension using gopls for coc.nvim. - josa42/coc-go","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/f3cbaec23c29801cbbb2087865c2e1e6b018d20f386163f025b5e7fa71be67bd/josa42/coc-go","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go#commands","original_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go#commands"}],"edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1621682851.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kUj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e74ea50-2d90-4224-8b7e-de0330379040","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"流石に対応してる気がしますね","ts":"1621682803.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I77"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce1a0547-4368-4fe0-b657-7de3c8c020e4","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"coc-references効かないんですかね？そんなことあるかな？","ts":"1621682783.104500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/rK9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21a3a512-cc56-43d3-bc9d-bc85176c31fc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"coc-goってreferenceコマンドがないのか…\n関数、変数の参照先を見たいとき、どうしているんだろ","ts":"1621682703.103700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cT=X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25638230-0b4e-4613-9175-8be10dc57d9a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕もスッキリしました！","ts":"1621649208.103100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k=DCK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cc99dd2-0adb-491d-ba25-5a51df480373","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1621649199.102900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i0Bm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a138143a-0a13-4611-9634-dbb568de50d4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"おお、動きました","ts":"1621649151.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vj5kW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1ba58f6-31f4-4b1e-9179-a568a122a106","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ちなみに coc-go の gopls の立ち上げ方は daemon モード？です。ps とかで見るとどこの立ち上がってるのかわかりやすいかも\n```yaegassy          2169   0.0  0.2  5005260  57304   ??  Ss   11:02AM   0:00.62 /Users/yaegassy/go/bin/gopls serve -listen unix;/var/folders/v_/b5wzz2q96q5cqgdtl3fq066r0000gn/T/gopls-282661-daemon.yaegassy -listen.timeout 1m0s```","ts":"1621649106.102500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RUOkI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"823e13f7-8f09-456d-bb44-b89357b1979e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"試してみます","ts":"1621649031.102300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A7YU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"798e2911-78b3-45a6-b4e3-efe428128d3d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、だからか\n自分の設定が優先されるの","ts":"1621649028.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6Ds"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e793e00-68da-4c01-878a-a8c4e8a19a8a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`\"go.goplsPath\": \"gopls\",`  に設定すると PATH が通ってる gopls が使われると思います。","ts":"1621649021.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b44321d6-7181-4316-a1b1-9b79c6098b56","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、coc-goでshellの見てるみたいなので。","ts":"1621648977.101100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ah6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e86ff7b7-9f50-4a4c-b2ea-f43600953c46","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"デフォルトはむしろその方が良い気がしますね\nあとでissue書いておくか","ts":"1621648900.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"35g0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31f005e4-7e62-4fd1-8d77-9bcff32b8d51","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"cocやVSCodeの拡張で、よくあるパターンのは、意外に泥臭いやつで os.homedir を使って ~ を置換したりとかですかね。例。\n```    if (file.startsWith('~/')) {\n      file = file.replace('~', homedir());\n    }```","ts":"1621648841.099800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hJkmx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dc01058-7bdc-4ad2-a1a1-b79d855e8385","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"諸々、ありがとうございます\nちょっと使ってみて、足りないなと思ったら色々PRしようと思います","ts":"1621648701.098500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lUZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c61eedde-a037-4efc-af39-eef4f10f4b47","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1621648681.098000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a6er"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4f8f417-faa5-447c-9acf-b56d111e794a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"うーん、どうでしょう。使えるようにナオス(PRする)って感じですね。おそらく今は使えないと思います。","ts":"1621648661.097800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YqD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ee1e5fd-3388-4a04-bc1c-dfc8361f20a5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど…\n環境変数って使えますか？\n使えるなら、$GOBIN/gopls みたいに設定できるなぁと","ts":"1621648618.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AF6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39515761-8e26-45f4-a2c7-b7892bbde59d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ただ、直せますよ。","ts":"1621648579.097000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j6gbX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2058ccfd-4a1f-4291-b378-e227cb434726","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"はい、残念ながら。","ts":"1621648567.096600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HqWlo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4573a627-d4f0-4139-80d4-04dcba98cede","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これって、フルパスが必要ですか？","ts":"1621648558.096400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KU6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff2b283a-4c6c-4302-865c-35c3d6ba653a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今丁度見ていました","ts":"1621648552.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e/I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b98c860-b3c1-4812-9df4-d4e19684d9f5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"go.goplsPath の設定があれば、それが優先されて使われますね","ts":"1621648520.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4hSO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbdd8387-cc64-44eb-be7e-09ffeefbd83d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"デフォルトはグローバルのを使わないのか","ts":"1621648479.095400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"um/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5552ffe0-df26-478a-b155-409da2ca33a8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1621648464.095000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7tCB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8560811-8b73-47a0-a4b7-4dc9dc30d24c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありますね","ts":"1621648462.094800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rQPE9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0c4032c-c292-40eb-8cef-3bb045c87435","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ほんとだ","ts":"1621648459.094500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0af0d6eb-748f-4ed6-973a-9e4c0f834aac","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```MacbookPro13% cd ~/.config/coc/extensions/coc-go-data/bin/\nMacbookPro13% ls -la\ndrwxr-xr-x skanehira staff 128 B  2021-05-22 10:51:18  .\ndrwxr-xr-x skanehira staff 128 B  2021-05-20 00:55:53  ..\n.rwxr-xr-x skanehira staff  21 MB 2021-05-22 10:40:22  gopls\n.rwxr-xr-x skanehira staff 8.9 MB 2021-05-22 10:51:18  gotests\nMacbookPro13%```","ts":"1621648457.094300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KBYt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f57d544-7278-4d0d-970d-109f959e55b7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほど。良かったです！僕も 1.16.x で動かないってお話はちょっと気になってたのでスッキリしました。ちなみに、coc-goのインストールコマンドで入れられた gopls は `~/.config/coc/extensions/coc-go-data/bin/gopls` にあるとおもいます。これが存在すれば、インストールコマンドが自動で走ったりはしないですね。","ts":"1621648384.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L4eq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8f9c57f-50b2-492f-96ca-9f31b1fd8232","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"issueにも書いておきました\n\u003chttps://github.com/josa42/coc-go/issues/148\u003e","ts":"1621648151.093600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Can't install binaries in Go1.16~ · Issue #148 · josa42/coc-go","id":1,"title":"Can't install binaries in Go1.16~ · Issue #148 · josa42/coc-go","title_link":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/issues/148","text":"I\u0026amp;#39;m try use coc-go in Go1.16 but I can\u0026amp;#39;t install binaries. [coc.nvim] Error: Command failed: env GOBIN=/Users/skanehira/.config/coc/extensions/coc-go-data/bin go get \u003chttp://golang.org/x/tools/gopl|golang.org/x/tools/gopl\u003e...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/88db50c87d3257841090738045f45197236cc5785cd8273735603e9dbc998d85/josa42/coc-go/issues/148","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/issues/148","original_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/issues/148"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5P2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9591dd6f-638c-48f6-baa7-4ed55ff91eb2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"定義ジャンプもできるので、正常に動いていそうです","ts":"1621648088.093300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q8qz2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fafea105-a1f9-4073-89e6-5133fd94d5bf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、普通に補完は動いていますね","ts":"1621648068.092900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Aw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1d22b26-bd5b-455f-86cf-4c29f7d544d7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 「普通に動いた」っていうのはゴリラさんのbashrc系からGO111MODULEの環境変数を消したら、coc-goが提供するgoplsのインストールは正常に完了したってことですよね？\nエラーはなくなりましたが、バイナリのインストール自体動いていないっぽいです\nすでに `vim-go` で入れてあるからかもしれないですが…","ts":"1621648048.092600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"79Hs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8ff4d87-e43f-4847-bb0c-bcee6ec60f84","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"理解しました。なるほどなるほど。","ts":"1621647815.091700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EIh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ac7f22d-29f0-488a-89f4-99d9c226a23a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"「普通に動いた」っていうのはゴリラさんのbashrc系からGO111MODULEの環境変数を消したら、coc-goが提供するgoplsのインストールは正常に完了したってことですよね？","ts":"1621647774.091400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qnt9+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6b2a50d-fee9-419a-b55d-e5d5e07783e8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"どうやら、coc-goの環境変数が効いていないっぽいので、その旨も書いておきます","ts":"1621647709.090400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e34827a-21ea-4bb9-af99-6bd575fb3f00","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"GO111MODULEの環境変数をなくしたら、普通に動きました","ts":"1621647681.089800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vig"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de0ad5f6-cddc-49e1-a7f4-8cacd1980e1f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほどなるほど。じゃあ、だいじょうぶですね。","ts":"1621647650.089100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZJ0Vl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cf80940-f604-441f-a756-88f05c007a86","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、issueはもう立ててあります","ts":"1621647587.088600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gSX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73a1348e-d661-4b43-969f-73b27f1de464","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほど。うーん。とりあえず僕が言いたいのは issue にしたほうが良いのではと思いました。僕の手元の環境ではインストールでコケないので気になったんですよね","ts":"1621647568.088300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gBji"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18b1c614-bd14-4ac3-b8fc-564aefe6b064","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; GO111MODULE: ‘on’,\nになっているのに、効いていないってことかな…","ts":"1621647424.088000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Y+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a930a67f-b167-485d-8119-68a165d7ffab","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/josa42/coc-go/blob/4ee552edc0449f4d99741f53d7b385500e1da21e/src/utils/tools.ts#L84-L90\u003e","ts":"1621647402.087500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: josa42/coc-go","id":1,"title":"josa42/coc-go","title_link":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/blob/4ee552edc0449f4d99741f53d7b385500e1da21e/src/utils/tools.ts#L84-L90","text":"Go language server extension using gopls for coc.nvim. - josa42/coc-go","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/05952e832bb74f90919ea79377f13d9a538005a7ec282bfc1d065bc22d864f8b/josa42/coc-go","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/blob/4ee552edc0449f4d99741f53d7b385500e1da21e/src/utils/tools.ts#L84-L90","original_url":"https://github.com/josa42/coc-go/blob/4ee552edc0449f4d99741f53d7b385500e1da21e/src/utils/tools.ts#L84-L90"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1EMW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaf2e6ff-99f4-4892-b915-22c5beaf41f3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"でもおかしいな、coc-goは GO111MODULE を on にしているコード見かけた気がするけど","ts":"1621647370.087300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zSQSA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0dfb195-731f-4e70-b8e6-0a8dc2a80b16","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ぼくは auto にしていますが","ts":"1621647348.086800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OBBD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf23471f-3c4d-4f88-a249-f026b3449b5e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"デフォルトは onですね","ts":"1621647339.086500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WU0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9d03747-3bbe-446e-8441-ff9cefc57527","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"GO111MODULE=on ってまだいりましたっけ？","ts":"1621647325.086300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2NbfE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7abbb7bd-ef5f-4f75-b0ca-fc386fa16cef","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"どうやら GO111MODULE=autoにしていたのが悪いみたい…\n```MacbookPro13% export GO111MODULE=on\nMacbookPro13% go get \u003chttp://golang.org/x/tools/gopls@latest|golang.org/x/tools/gopls@latest\u003e```","ts":"1621647311.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I17"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5e6d72f-372d-41ac-bb6d-31ab8f2dcb12","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"勿論、例えば自前で用意した gopls を設定することもできます。\n\n```  \"go.goplsPath\": \"/Users/yaegassy/go/bin/gopls\",```","ts":"1621647306.085800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bX1wf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e05c5b2-02c6-4ebb-9746-df06d1bacaf7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc-go はユーザー数、多いほうなので。さすがに 1.16 で動かないとかはissue出て、直しそうなものなのだと思うのですが。","ts":"1621647261.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7SYZ+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bdb9624-a9ce-4e4f-9504-7391d52bb7bb","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"失礼。1.16ですね。1.16.3です。","ts":"1621647210.083800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4FV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55b6c21b-969a-4535-b428-60103d31dfd5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; あと、気にはなってたんですが 1.6 に対応していない\n1.6 って書いているので、1.16なのかどうか、が気になっています","ts":"1621647184.083400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LOr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78fb2686-7b13-4e7f-aa03-707fc1182f2d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕はバイナリは正常にインストールされます。","ts":"1621647156.082400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dc52f9f-9b00-4b5a-ad46-918297d9f474","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 普通にgo getで完了してインストールされます。\ngo 1.16で、ですか？","ts":"1621647155.082300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iw8n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10d674d0-fe3f-49e5-b283-ad355677e54c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バイナリがインストールできないです","ts":"1621647140.081800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mRwJ="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6741cd5-8d84-4c11-8395-67bd74659b38","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、動くって語弊がありました","ts":"1621647122.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EMAZ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e92d7d8-c73d-4c33-ab54-7a27af3f6065","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"普通にgo getで完了してインストールされます。","ts":"1621647121.081300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gADP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65803364-8d5b-4341-a093-00f48fadad77","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですね","ts":"1621647107.080700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"28R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3a0d58d-39f3-4150-926a-9dce8e4d7078","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"動く、というか、まず coc-go の勝手に gopls をインストールする機能のがエラーで止まるってことですよね？","ts":"1621647101.080500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BZ5si"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10bffbb6-5086-4b15-be51-0ee8f4d48c8a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; あと、気にはなってたんですが 1.6 に対応していないっていうのはどういうことですかね？エラーが出てるのはわかりますが。僕の手元ではエラーでないね。\nあれ、1.16の場合 go install じゃないと動かないんですが、そちらは動くんですか？","ts":"1621647019.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8AXnZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f585bb32-48c6-4109-bd70-478707542c1c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、そういうことか","ts":"1621646984.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xuXH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cd80cce-85b4-43e7-a150-d1425711fdb1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あと、気にはなってたんですが 1.6 に対応していないっていうのはどういうことですかね？エラーが出てるのはわかりますが。僕の手元ではエラーでないね。","ts":"1621646983.078800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s1FE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4070df44-3d9b-4d5e-b